SUMMARY: Open WebUI Vulnerable to IDOR: Retrieval API Bypasses Knowledge Base Access Controls
DETAILS: # IDOR: Retrieval API Bypasses Knowledge Base Access Controls

**Author:** Andrew Orr <aorr@tenable.com>

