  - `controller`
  - `helpers`
  - `__vc_request`
- `lib/view_component/slot.rb`
  - `Slot#to_s`
- `lib/view_component/slotable.rb`
  - slot storage in `@__vc_set_slots`
- `lib/view_component/collection.rb`
  - child component memoization and spacer rendering

Key retained state:

```ruby
